-#
  DSP-06, DYN-19: the crew's SOS signals nobody has acknowledged, on every
  page of the staff. The sos controller sounds while there is one, and shows
  the hint while the browser holds the sound back.
#sos-strips{ data: { controller: "sos", sos_interval_value: 5 } }
  - calls.each do |call|
    = render "sos_calls/strip", call:
  %p.sos-hint{ hidden: true, data: { sos_target: "hint" } }= t(".no_sound")
